+# Order-triage custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives a runtime-owned canonical-instruction loader and requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`. The returned runtime agent has the ID `order-triage`, the action `classify-for-human-review`, and `canApproveRefunds` set to `false`.
+
+This repository does not implement the supplied loader or establish a model provider or invocation mechanism. Those runtime-owned details are therefore not asserted here.
